      <description>&lt;p&gt;De meest spectaculaire partij van Praag, 2026 was zonder enige twijfel het treffen tussen David Navara en Nodirbek Yakubboev.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/03QyvYHyPCQ?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Je kan de video ook bekijken op &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/ydykhga0bmli6zsnci11m/The-Entire-Chess-World-Is-Reeling-Over-This-Immortal-Game-6-Brilliancies.mp4?rlkey=o96gzvo59srzw9dncvwcqft1o&amp;amp;st=a37szwsm&amp;amp;dl=0&#34;&gt;dropbox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Je kan de partij hier naspelen:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;board&#34;&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/okra/js/pgnviewer.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;https://rphilips.github.io/okra/js/pgnviewer.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;style&gt;&#xA;san   {color: black;}&#xA;&lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;script&gt;&#xA;config = {&#xA;pgn: `[Event &#34;Prague International Chess Festival 2026 | Masters&#34;]&#xA;[Site &#34;Chess.com&#34;]&#xA;[Date &#34;2026.03.01&#34;]&#xA;[Round &#34;05&#34;]&#xA;[White &#34;Navara, David&#34;]&#xA;[Black &#34;Yakubboev, Nodirbek&#34;]&#xA;[Result &#34;1-0&#34;]&#xA;[WhiteElo &#34;2628&#34;]&#xA;[BlackElo &#34;2691&#34;]&#xA;[TimeControl &#34;40/5400+30:1800+30&#34;]&#xA;[Link &#34;https://www.chess.com/events/2026-prague-chess-festival-masters/05/Navara_David-Yakubboev_Nodirbek&#34;]&#xA